# Secrets only. Compose loads this file into the converter container.
# Feature flags, OCR, PDF, iWork, and tuning live in src/config.py.
# OCR engine: make build  (tesseract)  or  make build ollama
#
# How to set up: cp .env_template .env, fill in what you use, then
# `direnv allow .` once (direnv loads it automatically via .envrc from then
# on — see https://direnv.net). `make fresh-setup` does the copy for you.

# --- AI provider credentials (optional) -------------------------------------
# Model selection is provider-neutral: set vision_model / figure_model in
# twomarkdown/config.py (or `make build ollama OLLAMA_MODEL=...`) to a
# "<provider>:<model>" id. A bare name means Ollama, which needs no key.
#
#   ollama:qwen2.5vl:32b          local, no key, default
#   openai:gpt-5.2                needs OPENAI_API_KEY
#   anthropic:claude-sonnet-4-5   needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY
#   google:gemini-3-pro           needs GOOGLE_API_KEY
#   groq:llama-3.3-70b            needs GROQ_API_KEY
#
# Only uncomment what you actually use; pydantic-ai reads these from the
# environment, and compose passes this file into the container.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# MISTRAL_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
